Package: dtaparser
Title: Read Stata DTA Files with dta-parser
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Jonathan", "Bearak", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "jbearak@guttmacher.org")
Author: Jonathan Bearak [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Jonathan Bearak <jbearak@guttmacher.org>
Description: Provides an in-process R interface to the TypeScript dta-parser
    using an embedded V8 JavaScript context. It preserves Stata metadata,
    value labels, long strings, and extended missing-value tags and includes
    helpers for reproducible comparisons with haven.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    rlang,
    tibble,
    tidyselect,
    V8
Suggests:
    haven,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
